WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.720
Day 2 of fasting. Why would you fast? I personally believe that when you fast, you always do it for a reason. There is always a goal attached to fasting. Fasting just for the sake of it, just not eating for a day, is strange. It is good if you fast to hold on to a goal.

2
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:16.920
That one goal, the first goal is always to focus yourself on God. So you are always busy emptying yourself physically, so that you can fill yourself more with Him. That is always the very first and the most important reason. For some Christians, that is also the only reason and that's it. That is enough. So you can say I am going to fast to focus myself on God. Lord fill me,

3
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:25.040
but with ideas, new revelations. Then you are doing well by not eating for a day or not watching media for a day, in whatever case you want. Or a day when you are going to do a Daniel fast, where you only eat vegetables and fruit. In whatever way, for some people fasting to focus themselves on God as the ultimate goal is enough. Only I myself always have the question, why should I fast? Because I want

4
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:32.120
